{"english":[{"by":"machine","text":"Then some foreigners came, and I didn’t know how to talk to the two of them."}],"id":"7b2104683274e1c9","jyutping":"gam2 gan1 zyu6 ne1 jau5 di1 ngoi6 gwok3 jan4 lai4 ge3 gam2 m4 zi1 tung4 keoi5 dei6 loeng5 go3 king1 gai2","jyutpingBy":"corpus","text":"噉跟住呢，有啲外國人來嘅，噉唔知同佢哋兩個傾計。","words":[{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"c","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"gan1 zyu6","pos":"c","text":"跟住"},{"jyutping":"ne1","pos":"y1","text":"呢"},{"jyutping":"jau5 di1","pos":"r","text":"有啲"},{"jyutping":"ngoi6 gwok3 jan4","pos":"n","text":"外國人"},{"jyutping":"lai4","pos":"v","text":"來"},{"jyutping":"ge3","pos":"u","text":"嘅"},{"jyutping":"gam2","pos":"c","text":"噉"},{"jyutping":"m4","pos":"d","text":"唔"},{"jyutping":"zi1","pos":"v","text":"知"},{"jyutping":"tung4","pos":"p","text":"同"},{"jyutping":"keoi5 dei6","pos":"r","text":"佢哋"},{"jyutping":"loeng5","pos":"m","text":"兩"},{"jyutping":"go3","pos":"q","text":"個"},{"jyutping":"king1 gai2","pos":"v","text":"傾計"}]}
